drive — chosen Google Drive folders as a local, searchable library: Docs, Sheets, PDF and docx as
text, offline.

Usage: drive <profile> <command> [options]
Account commands start with your profile, a name you choose; none is ever assumed.

What you can do:
  folders add <url>                   choose folders; only these are imported
  sync --embed                        import what changed and index it by meaning
  search "budget decision"            every imported document, by words and meaning
  documents context <doc>             a document with its tags, notes and editors
  documents history <doc> --activity  who did what (needs --grant activity)
  memories extract <doc>              memories with exact quotes, proposed by a model
  documents export <doc>              Markdown in a new file (--output); never overwrites
  --read-only …                       this run refuses every change

Works with:
  tg                                  Telegram in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  max                                 MAX in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  wa                                  WhatsApp in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  zm                                  Zoom meetings: transcripts and summaries, searchable with your other WireCat data
  gcal                                Google Calendar events, searchable with your other WireCat data
  memo context <person>               one person across messengers, mail, notes and meetings
  mail                                IMAP mail in the same local store: search your mailbox offline, next to your other WireCat data

Start here:   drive personal session start  (any profile name works)
Next:         drive commands                every command, by section
              drive guide                   scenarios: command sequences for common tasks
              drive help options            output, offline, timeouts, dry run
For agents:   drive skill show              rules and the discovery loop
